# Slums monsters are SRD stat blocks: Kobold Warrior, Goblin Warrior and Bugbear
# Warrior (SRD 5.2.1) and Orc (SRD 5.1). A leader is its base stat block wearing
# the armor its original record readies; it shoots a bow only if its art shows one.
