# sunlight_sensitivity creature: Disadvantage on attack rolls and ability
# checks on a square open to the sky by day (the user, 2026-10-24).
sunlight_sensitivity slums-kobold
sunlight_sensitivity slums-kobold-leader
sunlight_sensitivity slums-kobold-leader-sword
advantage_damage slums-goblin 1 4
advantage_damage slums-goblin-leader 1 4
aggressive slums-orc
aggressive slums-orc-leader
aggressive slums-orc-leader-archer
# equipment creature metal_armor source armor: the creature wears Medium or Heavy
# metal armor, read from the armor its original record readies (#231; see
# docs/CREATURE-EQUIPMENT.md). Creatures without a row wear none.
equipment slums-goblin-leader metal_armor MON2CHA.DAX:3 scale_mail
equipment slums-orc-leader metal_armor MON2CHA.DAX:5 chain_mail
equipment slums-orc-leader-archer metal_armor MON2CHA.DAX:5 chain_mail
# Kuto's Well (docs/audits/kutos-well.md): Lizardfolk (SRD 5.1: two melee
# attacks a turn, a javelin at range), Giant Lizard and Gnoll Warrior (SRD 5.2.1;
# the gnoll's once-a-day Rampage is not modeled).
